litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerenabled=Printer
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerenabled=Places the blocks of the loaded schematic placements around you, using items from your inventory. Works on servers without any mod.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerrange=Printer Range
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerrange=How far around you (in blocks, 1 to 8) the printer places blocks.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerblockspertick=Blocks Per Tick
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerblockspertick=How many blocks the printer places in one game tick (1 to 16).
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printercooldownticks=Cooldown Ticks
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printercooldownticks=How many ticks the printer leaves a spot alone after it acted on it (1 to 40).
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printershape=Iteration Shape
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printershape=The shape of the area around you: sphere, octahedron or cube.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printeraxisorder=Axis Order
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printeraxisorder=The order the printer walks through the area: xzy, xyz, yxz, yzx, zxy or zyx (the first axis changes fastest).
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerfakerotation=Fake Rotation
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerfakerotation=Reports the rotation a block needs to the server just before placing it, so stairs, pistons, chests and the like face the way the schematic has them even on a server without a mod.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerfakeposition=Fake Position
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerfakeposition=For pistons, observers, dispensers and droppers facing up or down: reports a position above or below the block for the click, and the real one right after.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerredstoneorder=Redstone Order
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerredstoneorder=Places the blocks a component depends on first, and pistons, observers and the like last, so nothing fires while the build is half done.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerpausewhilemining=Pause While Mining
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerpausewhilemining=The printer pauses while you break a block by hand, and does not put back a block you broke by hand where the schematic wanted exactly that block.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.easyplacefakerotation=Easy Place Fake Rotation
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.easyplacefakerotation=Makes Litematica's Easy Place work on servers without a mod: the rotation and position a block needs are reported to the server for the click.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerbreakwrongblock=Break Wrong Blocks
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerbreakwrongblock=Mines a block that is not the schematic's block (inside a placement) with real survival mining, then places the right one. Never touches blocks outside the placement or blocks that are right.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerbreakextrablock=Break Extra Blocks
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerbreakextrablock=Mines a block where the schematic has air, inside a placement.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerbreakwrongstateblock=Break Wrong State Blocks
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerbreakwrongstateblock=Mines a block that is the right block but in the wrong state (facing, half, axis...), then places it again.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerautotool=Auto Tool
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerautotool=Holds the tool from your inventory that mines the block fastest while the printer or the destroy assist mines.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerusetools=Use Tools
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerusetools=Builds farmland with a hoe on dirt or grass, and lights nether portals with flint and steel.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerscaffold=Scaffold
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerscaffold=Fence gates over air: places a temporary block under the gate, places the gate, then mines the block away again.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerfillcontainers=Fill Containers
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerfillcontainers=Opens built hoppers, droppers, dispensers, chests, trapped chests (also double chests), furnaces, brewing stands and shulker boxes and puts the schematic's items into their slots. Slots with other items are left alone; a furnace's output slot stays empty (the game takes nothing put there).
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerfluids=Fluids
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerfluids=Places water and lava sources of the schematic with buckets from your inventory.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printericewater=Ice Water
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printericewater=Makes water sources from ice (placed and mined without Silk Touch) when you carry no water bucket.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printersnowlayers=Snow Layers
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printersnowlayers=Builds snow up to the schematic's number of layers.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printersigntextpaste=Sign Text Paste
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printersigntextpaste=Fills a newly opened sign editor with the text of the schematic's sign at the same place.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.destroyassist=Destroy Assist
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.destroyassist=Holding the attack button on a block the placement wants gone mines all such blocks in reach, one after another. Other blocks are never touched.
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerlimittolayerrange=Limit To Layer Range
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerlimittolayerrange=The printer only works inside the layers Litematica shows (the render layer range).
litematica_upgraded.config.name.printerstopafterdeath=Stop After Death
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.printerstopafterdeath=Turns the printer off when you die.
litematica_upgraded.gui.button.material.replace=Replace
litematica_upgraded.gui.hover.material.replace=Swaps this block for another one in the whole placement (facing, half and other matching properties are kept). Only the loaded schematic changes, the file stays as it is until you save it. Replace back to undo.
litematica_upgraded.title.screen.material.replace=Replace %s with
litematica_upgraded.message.material.replaced=Replaced %s blocks of %s with %s
litematica_upgraded.message.material.replace_none=Nothing to replace: no block of %s in the placement
litematica_upgraded.config.name.credits=Credits
litematica_upgraded.config.comment.credits=The printer and Easy Place rotation come from Schematica Upgraded, built on Schematica by Lunatrius and Schematica Plus by HackerRouter (MIT licence). Litematica and malilib are by masa (LGPL-3.0).

